entries[332006] = { ["name"] = "Shadowghast Armguards", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nTools: Blacksmith Hammer\nReagents:\nShadowghast Ingot (30), Enchanted Elethium Bar (12), Luminous Flux (30), Orboreal Shard (12)\nOptional Reagents:\nIncrease Rank (#78)\nCreate a piece of plate armor that is worthy of being infused with the power necessary to become a Legendary item.\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-Equipped: Shadowlands Crafted Legendary (1)Wrist Plate\n32 Armor\n+11 [Strength or Intellect]+17 Stamina\n+ 11 Random Stat 1\n+ 11 Random Stat 2\nDurability 70 / 70\n60\n\"An exceptionally well crafted piece of armor worthy of being empowered by the Runecarver.\"" }
